cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this skill, please cite it as below."
title: "Research Repository Setup"
abstract: >-
  This experimental skill applies reproducible research-computing guidance to repository setup and review. It helps document project scope, structure, provenance, and data-handling decisions without prescribing one universal directory tree. It does not determine scientific validity, legal permissions, or institutional compliance.
